<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hu">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
    <title>Rövid technikai szünet – KwizzGo</title>
    <style>
        *{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 15%,#352071 0,#11122d 38%,#07091b 100%);color:#f8fafc;font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}.error-card{width:min(720px,100%);padding:clamp(32px,7vw,72px);text-align:center;border:1px solid rgba(250,204,21,.28);border-radius:32px;background:rgba(10,12,34,.9);box-shadow:0 30px 90px rgba(0,0,0,.45)}.mark{display:grid;place-items:center;width:84px;height:84px;margin:0 auto 26px;border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#7c3aed,#14b8a6);font-size:38px;font-weight:950;box-shadow:0 18px 45px rgba(124,58,237,.35)}.kicker{margin:0 0 12px;color:#facc15;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase}.error-card h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(39px,8vw,70px);line-height:1;font-weight:950;letter-spacing:-.05em}.error-card h1 span{color:#2dd4bf}.lead{max-width:550px;margin:26px auto 0;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:clamp(17px,3vw,21px);line-height:1.65}.status{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:30px;padding:11px 18px;border:1px solid rgba(45,212,191,.25);border-radius:999px;background:rgba(20,184,166,.1);color:#99f6e4;font-weight:800}.dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#2dd4bf;box-shadow:0 0 18px #2dd4bf}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:12px;margin-top:28px}.actions a{padding:12px 18px;border-radius:12px;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:850;background:#6d3bd1}.actions a:last-child{color:#cbd5e1;border:1px solid #38405f;background:transparent}
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="error-card">
    <div class="mark" aria-hidden="true">500</div>
    <p class="kicker">Rövid technikai szünet</p>
    <h1>A játék mindjárt<br><span>folytatódik!</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">Valami váratlan történt, de a hibát már rögzítettük. Próbáld újra egy kis idő múlva.</p>
    <div class="status"><span class="dot"></span> A KwizzGo csapata dolgozik rajta</div>
    <div class="actions"><a href="javascript:location.reload()">Újrapróbálom</a><a href="/">Vissza a főoldalra</a></div>
</main>
</body>
</html>
